{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Cindy.Cindy","latestVersion":"0.1.128","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.ee7a7da3.png","priority":1,"sha256":"ee7a7da3d3630ca761074d163b53b10f073aff7ce375e76a9affc8a18e1ba3a9","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"XD Inc.","description":"An open-source AI agent that works out of the box. Consider it done.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"XD Inc.","description":"An open-source AI agent that works out of the box. Consider it done.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Cindy is an open-source AI agent that works out of the box. She brings multiple harnesses, models, and tools into one agent that finishes real work in your projects and apps. Ready from day one, yours to shape over time.\nCindy runs locally on your own machine, using your real files and logged-in apps. The first supported harnesses are Claude Code and Codex, with more being added. Models and harnesses mix freely and can switch mid-task while your workspace, memory, skills, and tools stay continuous; one task can even be planned, executed in parallel, and reviewed by agents on different harness and model combinations.","name":"Cindy","packageUrl":"https://cindy.app/","privacyUrl":"https://protocol.xd.com/cindy/privacy.html","publisher":"XD Inc.","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues","publisherUrl":"https://www.xd.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/tag/v0.1.38","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","large-language-model","llm"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一个开源、开箱即用的 AI Agent：想到，就能做到。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Cindy 是一个开源、开箱即用的 AI Agent。她把多套 Harness、模型和工具收进同一个持续成长的伙伴，在真实工程和软件里把任务做完。一开始就好用，任你打扮，任你培养。\nCindy 运行在你自己的电脑上，使用你本地的文件和已登录的应用。首批兼容 Claude Code 与 Codex 两套 Agent Harness，更多 Harness 正在接入。模型与 Harness 自由组合、同一任务中随时切换，工作现场、记忆、Skill 和工具始终连续；一个任务还可以由不同 Harness 与模型组合的多个 agent 规划、并行执行、独立 review。","releaseNotes":"Desktop release 0.1.128\n更新说明\n🔌 重复 MCP 连接会提醒\n当 Cindy 与 Claude Code 的配置里有相同或相近的 MCP 连接时，会提示你选择保留哪个来源，并记住这台电脑上的选择；同名服务的识别和设置兼容也更准确。 @DavidShenXD\n🖥️ macOS Dock 图标已恢复\n修复 0.1.127 打包版在 macOS 上 Dock 图标空白的问题，打包版重新显示正常图标。 @GaoWeiLiuXD\n⏰ 自动化运行更可靠\n自动化的截止时间处理更稳：到期后会正确停止或顺延，尚未执行的一次性自动化会按时恢复；配置页的触发方式文案和页签名称也已统一。 @DavidShenXD\n🌐 「我的浏览器」不再占用你的页签\n「我的浏览器」默认在 Cindy 自己的窗口新开页签，不再读取、点击或跳转你已打开的页面；需要时会沿用同一网站的地址，登录状态仍然共用。 @dashhuang\n📱 手机端 PR 状态不再丢失\n手机首页的任务行和伙伴近况里，PR 关联与状态会保存下来，应用重启后立即显示并在后台刷新；首次查询失败或赶上刷新时也不会再被清空。 @dashhuang\n📡 远程任务选模型更顺\n远程新建任务时可以直接选用远程电脑提供的模型来源，选中后不会再被清空；远程任务出错时会保留可操作的供应商指引，输入框的输入建议也会正常恢复。 @Battleplus @DavidShenXD @GaoWeiLiuXD\n🔁 共享任务恢复说明更清楚\n共享任务需要恢复时会说明原因，并允许你明确选择另一台电脑；联系分享电脑失败时不再误报其他电脑离线，未确认的任务也保持正常速度运行。 @yan-xdt\n🤖 伙伴消息更顺畅\n伙伴在后台作业运行时也能正常接收新消息，不再一直提示「伙伴能力正在刷新」；从其他任务派来的消息在自动续跑或重试时，也不会被误判为撤权而静默停住。 @Shaojie66\n✅ GitLab 检查更准确\nGitLab 项目现在会显示合并结果流水线检查；没有流水线时显示为零项检查，重试和手动作业的统计也不再算错。 @fmfsaisai\n🛠️ 日常使用的小问题修复\n手机端错误提示不再显示多余操作按钮，隐藏页面的动画会暂停；群聊话题输入框里的「AI 代答」入口已收回，电脑操作失败时的提示也更准确。 @DavidShenXD @dashhuang\nPRs\n#8606 #9009 #9016 #9024 #9055 #9056 #9059 #9063 #9069 #9070 #9071 #9073 #9078 #9079 #9086 #9091 #9093 #9097 #9098 #9099 #9104\n\n- commit: 9d62b213c960c63daa46996de8a606965f2f2299\n- source tag: beta2026-11-06_18-14-41\n- regions: cn global\n- iOS(cn):整包 0.1.23(2026110401) · 热更 ad4564f3\n- Android(cn):整包 0.1.34(47) · 热更 44e30aa2\n- iOS(global):整包 0.1.23(2026110401) · 热更 3e86111b\n- Android(global):整包 0.1.34(40) · 热更 9b25d925","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/tag/v0.1.128","tags":["人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"Cindy is an open-source AI agent that works out of the box. She brings multiple harnesses, models, and tools into one agent that finishes real work in your projects and apps. Ready from day one, yours to shape over time.\nCindy runs locally on your own machine, using your real files and logged-in apps. The first supported harnesses are Claude Code and Codex, with more being added. Models and harnesses mix freely and can switch mid-task while your workspace, memory, skills, and tools stay continuous; one task can even be planned, executed in parallel, and reviewed by agents on different harness and model combinations.","name":"Cindy","packageUrl":"https://cindy.app/","privacyUrl":"https://protocol.xd.com/cindy/privacy.html","publisher":"XD Inc.","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues","publisherUrl":"https://www.xd.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/releases/tag/v0.1.38","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","large-language-model","llm"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.128/app.json","detailSha256":"4a7b03a40fc76f483286986c6581be12cab1697bf4ffce48467ec618c99fc291","releaseDate":"2026-11-06","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"0.1.128"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.126/app.json","detailSha256":"d04034aee63516ef542f4cf7ce0f8bf3f6c8c199a1f1eb61e6bcd8ee6b8cfd92","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"0.1.126"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.125/app.json","detailSha256":"c7c54d3c63dc2d30489fbe67b1446827ff8ff5f844bf50a3a7584e9b5029d483","releaseDate":"2026-11-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.125"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.124/app.json","detailSha256":"8b455c7b2f241772c79cba8bfa6a3e0793fc95619a8d7478b2bb13c0a8a33819","releaseDate":"2026-11-03","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.124"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.121/app.json","detailSha256":"91ea54c6d5409bd17d80caa3e4599b08dd37ba3eb79f3851061b2a96239eeb5a","releaseDate":"2026-10-30","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.1.121"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.1.120/app.json","detailSha256":"3771efe40f1